  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0: Requires Abstractions v3.0.0 — VectorFilter.ByMetadata/ByNamespace/ByScope and MetadataMatch are removed. Use new fluent API: new VectorFilter().Where(...). Filter evaluation engine updated to support the full condition tree (Eq/Ne/In/NotIn/Gt/Gte/Lt/Lte/Like/Exists/NotExists, And/Or groups) via recursive EvaluateConditions.",
